    "Korean potential seed production and peak sediment bank are aggregate estimates and separate samples, not tracked cohort; 2008/09 recruitment matched only to preceding 2008 seed bank as in authors' life table; seedling-to-developed counts derived from monthly quadrat observations, not individually marked seed fates. 2009 potential/seed bank not combined with earlier recruitment. Two years of same two populations, no independent replication or sampling covariance.",
